      "claim": "Mannitol, a small polar hexitol, has absolute oral bioavailability of 63% in healthy adult men and ~20-24% in colonoscopy patients at 50-150 g doses; L2 adds ~20% and ~0.5 fraction-absorbed records, supporting F>=20% for polar small molecules.",
      "card_ids": ["C04", "C02", "C06", "C10", "C11", "C12", "C15", "C20", "C26", "C32", "C56", "C66"]
